  "title": "Solid interim performance supported by favourable gold price",
  "summary": "Johannesburg, South Africa. 9 February 2026. DRDGOLD Limited expects to report earnings per share (EPS) of between 216.9 cents and 228.2 cents and headline earnings per share (HEPS) of between 217.5 cents and 228.7 cents for the six months ended 31 December 2025, compared to an EPS and HEPS of 112.6 cents in the prior corresponding period (six months ended 31 December 2024), representing an increase of between 93% and 103%.",
